C("Search text for the literal lowercase token café, precomposed, with no Unicode letter immediately before or after it. Digits, marks and punctuation are valid boundaries; case and normalization are not ignored.",r"(?<!\p{L})café(?!\p{L})","café|a café b|(café)|café1|2café|_café_|\ncafé\n|café́","Café|café|xcafé|caféx|écafé|café東|CAFÉ|cafe","Unicode letter boundaries must work beyond ASCII.","u",True)
C("An uppercase international code is 3 through 8 Unicode uppercase letters, followed by hyphen and two ASCII digits. Other letter categories, combining marks and lowercase are forbidden.",r"\p{Lu}{3,8}-[0-9]{2}","ABC-00|ABCDEFGH-99|ÉTÉ-12|ΑΒΓ-34|ЗИМА-56|ŁÓDŹ-78|ÅÄÖ-01|XYZ-98","AB-00|ABCDEFGHI-00|AbC-00|東京東-00|ABC-0|ABC-000|ABC-١٢|ABC_00","Uppercase category is narrower than all letters.","u")
C("A bilingual code consists of 2 to 6 Latin-script Unicode letters, colon, 2 to 6 Greek-script Unicode letters. Marks, digits and spaces are forbidden. Each side must contain at least one uppercase and one lowercase letter within its own script.",r"(?=[^:]*\p{Lu})(?=[^:]*\p{Ll})(?:(?=\p{L})\p{Script=Latin}){2,6}:(?=[^:]*\p{Lu})(?=[^:]*\p{Ll})(?:(?=\p{L})\p{Script=Greek}){2,6}","Ab:Αβ|Éé:Ωω|Abcdef:Αβγδεζ|Zz:Δέλτα|Åå:Ππ|Foo:Σσ|Łł:Ξξ|Xy:Ήη","AB:Αβ|ab:Αβ|Ab:ΑΒ|Ab:αβ|A:Αβ|Ab:Α|Abcdefg:Αβ|Ab:Αβγδεζη|Ab:Αa","Script-specific alphabets and case-category presence interact on both sides.","u")
C("A Unicode echo token is 2 through 6 Unicode letters followed by slash and the exact same code-point sequence. Combining marks are forbidden, and the first half must contain both an uppercase and a lowercase Unicode letter.",r"(?=[^/]*\p{Lu})(?=[^/]*\p{Ll})([\p{L}]{2,6})\/\1","Ab/Ab|Éé/Éé|Αβ/Αβ|Зи/Зи|Åå/Åå|Abcdef/Abcdef|Foo/Foo|Łł/Łł","AB/AB|ab/ab|Ab/aB|Ab/Ac|A/A|Abcdefg/Abcdefg|é/é|東京/東京","Exact code-point equality is not normalization or case folding.","u")
C("An international identifier has 4 through 12 code points consisting only of Unicode letters, marks and ASCII digits. It starts with a letter, each letter may be followed by at most one mark, and every digit stands alone. It must include a mark and a digit; no adjacent digits.",r"(?=.{4,12}$)(?=.*\p{M})(?=.*[0-9])(?!.*[0-9]{2})\p{L}\p{M}?(?:\p{L}\p{M}?|[0-9])*","áb1|éx2|Äb3|άβ4|и́я5|á1b|a1b́|ábcdefghij1","abc1|ábc|́ab1|á̈b1|áb12|áb١|á1́b|ábcdefghijk1","Marks attach only to letters while digit placement and total length are independent.","u")
envelope("A Unicode note is entirely enclosed in UNI{ and }UNI. The interior is 1 to 40 Unicode code points, allows any characters and newlines, and includes the lowercase substring texte.","UNI{","}UNI","texte")
C("An LF-only Unicode receipt has name= then 2 through 6 Unicode letters including both an uppercase and lowercase letter, then LF and copy= with exactly the same code points. No marks, spaces or final LF.",r"name=(?=[^\n]*\p{Lu})(?=[^\n]*\p{Ll})(\p{L}{2,6})\ncopy=\1","name=Ab\ncopy=Ab|name=Éé\ncopy=Éé|name=Αβ\ncopy=Αβ|name=Зи\ncopy=Зи|name=Åå\ncopy=Åå|name=Abcdef\ncopy=Abcdef|name=Foo\ncopy=Foo|name=Łł\ncopy=Łł","name=AB\ncopy=AB|name=ab\ncopy=ab|name=Ab\ncopy=aB|name=A\ncopy=A|name=Abcdefg\ncopy=Abcdefg|name=é\ncopy=é|name=Ab\r\ncopy=Ab","Case-category constraints and exact cross-line reuse apply to Unicode code points.","u")
C("A Latin alias has 4 through 12 Latin-script Unicode letters only, includes at least one uppercase and one lowercase letter, and has no adjacent identical code points. Marks, digits and spaces are forbidden; no normalization is done.",r"(?=.{4,12}$)(?=.*\p{Lu})(?=.*\p{Ll})(?!.*(\p{L})\1)(?:(?=\p{L})\p{Script=Latin})+","Abcd|ÉtéA|ÅaÅa|Abcdefghijkl|ZzZz|Straße|Łódź|Naïve","ABCD|abcd|Abc|Abcdefghijklm|AbbC|AééB|Abαd|éAbc|Ab1c","Script membership, case presence and adjacency compare exact code points.","u")
C("A Cyrillic echo code is two distinct Cyrillic-script Unicode letters, colon, the same two letters in reverse order. Each code point must be a letter, not a mark; equality is case sensitive and no normalization is done.",r"((?=\p{L})\p{Script=Cyrillic})(?!\1)((?=\p{L})\p{Script=Cyrillic}):\2\1","Аб:бА|Яя:яЯ|Жз:зЖ|Ий:йИ|Юю:юЮ|Бв:вБ|Де:еД|Зи:иЗ","АА:АА|Аб:Аб|Аб:ба|Aб:бA|А1:1А|А́:́А|Абб:ббА","Script, distinctness and reversed exact equality are independent.","u")
